<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on China Light.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on China Light.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Tuesday it launched 230 million warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>    STRIKE PRICE     HK$37.40	PREMIUM	    8.9 PCT</p>
<p>    ISSUE PRICE	HK$1.0516     GEARING	    4.18X</p>
<p>    EXPIRATION	 10.JUN.98     PAYMENT DATE     04.JUL.97</p>
<p>    LISTING	    HONG KONG     LISTING DATE     08.JUL.97</p>
<p>    SPOT REFERENCE   HK$44.00	BOARD LOT	  5,000</p>
<p>    NOTE		 CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT THE</p>
<p>			   DISCRETION OF THE ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
